  "REGISTER: POST /auth/register → bcrypt hashes password → User saved to MongoDB → JWT returned",
  "LOGIN:    POST /auth/login → password compared with bcrypt → JWT returned → stored in Zustand (localStorage)",
  "REQUEST:  Axios interceptor reads token from Zustand → adds Authorization header → server verifies JWT",
  "EXPIRE:   Server returns 401 → Axios response interceptor → calls logout() → redirects to /login",
  "LOGOUT:   useAuthStore.logout() called → token cleared from Zustand + localStorage",
], LAVEND, PURPLE),
